# Simulation outputs (Questa work libraries, waveforms, Radiant sim projects)
# are large and are rebuilt on every run. Track only the testbench sources
# and the small result files.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!*.sv
!*.svh
!*.do
!*.mpf
!predictions*.txt
!*.log
!transcript

# Questa compile library, even the files above would match
work/
